send to either the Stackdriver

00:17:19.460 --> 00:17:22.990
or what you actually
want to send to a storage

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:28.750
maybe for long-term
analysis if you want to keep

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:30.970
